Description:

imapd advertises SEARCH=FUZZY only when search_engine is xapian,
the one engine that does fuzzy matching, and otherwise accepts and
ignores the FUZZY search key.
For the same reason, search_fuzzy_always, the search-fuzzy-always annotation
and the searchfuzzy client quirk now have no effect unless search_engine is
xapian.


Documentation:

The RFC 6203 note on the RFC support page;
imapd.conf(5), search_fuzzy_always.


Config changes:

search_fuzzy_always has no effect unless search_engine is xapian.


Upgrade instructions:

None.


